        <mxCell id="B9T2sEOQCew7ohuAX01h-66" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Dev Shared WS&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every functional areas will have its own shared workspace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Developer will use their own workspace as sandbox&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Developers will have read write access in dev workspace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No access will if the personal workspace link will share&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once development done it will push to QA same functional area with the help of Git or VS code&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
