        <mxCell id="B9T2sEOQCew7ohuAX01h-84" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;PRD Pro WS&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;This is premium work space. 400GB capacity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Each load will happen through &amp;nbsp;Git control&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Every QA workspace deploy to respective &amp;nbsp;folders of premium workspace&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;There will be two section of premium workspace 1. Operational 2 Executive&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Report can access through Power BI App only as because all access control will maintain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Only AD group access and the AD group owner will be respective business lead&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
